# A machine's own runner config: the paths of somebody's checkouts. Not the
# repository's to carry. npm's packer reads this file too, and it is HERE
# rather than in tools/ because a .gitignore beside package.json cannot
# override `files` (which names runner/ whole) while one in a subdirectory
# can — so this one line keeps the file out of git and out of the tarball.
macbook-laptop.json
